	</span>
</h1>
<p>Attribution methods answer:</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>Which tokens (or spans) influenced the model output the most?</s=
trong></p>
</blockquote>
<p>Interpreto implements <strong>two subfamilies</strong> of attribution:</=
p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Inference / perturbation-based methods</strong> (query the mode=
l on modified inputs, and study consequences in the outputs)</li>
<li><strong>Gradient-based methods</strong> (backprop through the model)</l=
i>
</ul>
<p>Interpreto=E2=80=99s attribution tutorial notebook covers both classific=
ation and generation use cases. </p>
