	</a>
	<span>
		Step 1: Split the model and extract activations
	</span>
</h2>
<p>To split your model and extract activations, in Interpreto, you should u=
se the <a href=3D"https://for-sight-ai.github.io/interpreto/api/concepts/mo=
del_with_split_points/" rel=3D"nofollow"><code>ModelWithSplitPoints</code><=
/a> wrapper around your Hugging Face model. Our concept-based explainers ar=
e based on it. You go from your (I -&gt; O) <code>model</code> to a <code>m=
odel_with_split_points</code> (I -&gt; A -&gt; O). This class is built usin=
g the <a href=3D"https://github.com/ndif-team/nnsight" rel=3D"nofollow"><co=
de>nnsight</code></a> library.</p>
<p>Running example for concept-based explanation on a generation model. Con=
cepts are learned on a dataset of 100 news headlines from the AG News datas=
et.</p>
<div class=3D"relative group repo-copy-code"><pre><code class=3D"language-p=
ython"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">import</span> datasets
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">from</span> transformers <span class=3D"hljs-k=
eyword">import</span> AutoModelForCausalLM
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">from</span> interpreto <span class=3D"hljs-key=
word">import</span> ModelWithSplitPoints

TOKEN =3D ModelWithSplitPoints.activation_granularities.TOKEN

<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># 1.1 Split your model in two parts</span>
model_with_split_points =3D ModelWithSplitPoints(
    <span class=3D"hljs-string">"Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B"</span>,
    automodel=3DAutoModelForCausalLM,
    split_points=3D[<span class=3D"hljs-number">5</span>],  <span class=3D"=
hljs-comment"># split at the sixth layer, the last one</span>
)

<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># 1.2 Compute a dataset of activations</span>
dataset =3D datasets.load_dataset(<span class=3D"hljs-string">"fancyzhx/ag_=
news"</span>)[<span class=3D"hljs-string">"train"</span>][<span class=3D"hl=
js-string">"text"</span>][:<span class=3D"hljs-number">100</span>]  <span c=
lass=3D"hljs-comment"># you should include as many examples as you can</spa=
n>
activations =3D model_with_split_points.get_activations(dataset, TOKEN)
</code></pre><button class=3D"absolute top-3 right-3 transition opacity-0 g=
roup-hover:opacity-80"><svg class=3D"" xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"=
