	</a>
	<span>
		Evaluation Metrics for Concept-Based Explanations
	</span>
</h2>
<p>A global, end-to-end evaluation is provided through <code>ConSim</code>,=
 which evaluates explanation in general.</p>
<p>In addition, Interpreto provides metrics that specifically target the <s=
trong>concept decomposition (dictionary learning) stage</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Faithfulness</strong>: evaluates how well the learned concepts =
reconstruct the original activations, using metrics such as <code>MSE</code=
>, <code>FID</code>, and <code>ReconstructionError</code>.</li>
<li><strong>Complexity</strong>: evaluates the concept-space complexity, ma=
inly through the <code>Sparsity</code> metric.</li>
</ul>
